    "text": "For exothermic reaction.\r\n$\\because$\r\n$K_{p} \\propto \\frac{1}{T}$\r\nThus, as $\\frac{1}{T}$ increases (i.e. $T$ decreases), $K_{p}$ increases.\r\n$\\because$ $\\Delta$ H for exothermic reactions is negative."
